--- MEMORY OPTIMIZATION RESULTS ---
Official repo: 4 tabs + Extra mirrors configured: 8 tabs + All and Others tab: 2 tabs = 14 tabs.
Packages: + 15k :: With the 'All' tab: + 30k :: 4 items per table: + 120k items.

1. Peak Update Usage
Before: 950 MB
After: 315 MB
Reduction: 66.8% less RAM.

2. Continuous / Initial Usage
Before: 450 MB
After: 300 MB
Reduction: 33.3% less RAM.

3. System Stability (Peak Fluctuation)
Before: Spiked from 450 MB to 950 MB (+111% memory surge and leak).
After: Rises from 300 MB to 315 MB (only +5% transient fluctuation).
